Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the analysis and
extraction tools, the recovery scoring harness, the recompilation runtime, the
build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Rise of Nations: Rise of Legends itself. No game
code, no game binaries and no extracted assets are committed here -- ever --
and you need your own retail copy for any of this to be useful. The lifted C is
a derivative work of that binary; it is generated from your own copy and is not
tracked in this repository.

